    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Alerts users when a transform grids are required (or desired) for an operation between two CRSes, yet they are not available on the current system. Derived from the QgsAppCoordinateOperationHandlers class created by QGIS developer Nyall Dawson. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
